###############################################################################
# Worldsmith - .gitignore for a C# / .NET RimWorld (Harmony) mod
###############################################################################

## .NET build intermediates and output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.binlog
msbuild*.log

# The compiled mod assembly lives in Assemblies/ and ships with the mod, so it
# is intentionally TRACKED (the .csproj OutputPath points there). Reference
# DLLs are not copied in (Private=false), so nothing else lands there.

## Debug symbols (DebugType=none by default, so normally none are produced)
*.pdb
*.mdb

## IDE / editor cruft
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.DotSettings.user
_ReSharper*/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

###############################################################################
# Local-only reference material. NOT for publication.
#
# These hold third-party and decompiled code / binaries that must not be
# redistributed with this GPL mod. They are kept locally for reference and are
# never committed. Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
###############################################################################
context-files/
bug-reports/
other-mods/
photoshop/
NOTES.md
